  "18": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Katak tomoni $d$ bo‘lsin. Rasmdan: $X$ va $Y$ gorizontal $4I$ tokdan $2d$ yuqorida, vertikal $I$ tokdan esa $X$ chapda, $Y$ o‘ngda $d$ masofada. To‘g‘ri tok maydoni $B=\\frac{\\mu_0I}{2\\pi r}$."
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$4I$ tok (o‘ngga) har ikkala nuqtada bir xil maydon beradi: $B'\\propto\\frac{4I}{2d}=\\frac{2I}{d}$, chizma tekisligidan bizga qarab. $I$ tok (yuqoriga) $X$ da bizga qarab, $Y$ da chizma ichiga $\\frac Id$ maydon beradi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "B_X\\propto\\frac{2I}{d}+\\frac{I}{d}=\\frac{3I}{d},\\qquad B_Y\\propto\\frac{2I}{d}-\\frac{I}{d}=\\frac{I}{d},\\qquad \\frac{B_X}{B_Y}=3"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 3"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
